<title>UK: Municipality Finance sets 150 mln Fin mark bond.</title>
<headline>Municipality Finance sets 150 mln Fin mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Unibank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MUNICIPALITY FINANCE (FINLAND)</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN FIM   COUPON     *5.875    MATURITY  **18.SEP.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.30     PAY DATE    18.SEP.96</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR YEARS ONE TO FIVE, 8.950 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	     **CALL ON 18.SEP.01</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (M) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE MTN PROGRAMME</p>
